 "rule": [
  "Schemas are copied from definitions and definitions.v2 with $ref rewritten to #/schemas/<name>.",
  "Annotation keywords are removed: description, title, format, default, examples, minimum, maximum and $schema. A property named title stays.",
  "allOf with one member is replaced by that member; const is rewritten as a one-member enum.",
  "A property the adapter neither writes nor reads keeps its name with the empty schema {}, so its graph stays out.",
  "ThreadItem keeps the userMessage, agentMessage, fileChange, commandExecution and mcpToolCall variants; UserInput keeps its text variant.",
  "Config keeps its open object and pins only mcp_servers, the one field the adapter reads.",
  "ThreadStartResponse also names activePermissionProfile, multiAgentMode and runtimeWorkspaceRoots with {}: only the --experimental bundle declares them, and 0.160.0 sends them to a client that did not opt in.",
  "JSONRPCNotification also names emittedAtMs, an integer only the --experimental ServerNotification union declares; 0.160.0 stamps every notification with it.",
  "McpServerElicitationRequestParams copies its shared serverName, threadId and turnId into each mode branch, since the checker closes each object it checks.",
  "The checker closes every object; Codex's own JSON-RPC envelopes carry no jsonrpc member."
 ],
